## Cloud Network Endpoints
Discovering misconfigured cloud infrastructure allows you to find open storage buckets or internal entry points.
## Finding Public & Edge Endpoints

* Subdomain Enumeration: Use Subfinder, Amass, or Assetfinder to discover all public-facing assets.
* DNS Brute-Forcing: Use PureDNS with massive wordlists to find active cloud-hosted subdomains.

## Locating Private Endpoints

* SSRF Exploitation: If the target app has a "fetch URL" feature, exploit Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF) to scan internal metadata addresses (e.g., http://169.254.169.254).
* DNS Wildcarding: Look for internal naming conventions like ://target.com or ://target.com.

