## Clinical Trial Endpoints
Note: You cannot hack a medical endpoint protocol, but you can find the software portals hosting this sensitive data.
## Finding Clinical Systems

* Google Dorking: Search for exposed medical data platforms using specific search operators:
* site:target.com inurl:clinical
   * site:target.com intitle:"eCRF" (Electronic Case Report Forms)
   * site:target.com "clinical trial" ext:pdf

